* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
*
** RCHKRP
** CHECK IF A REPORT EXIST
*** Author :Michel
* xsiszha 2000-08-01 (CE7461) Extend Report and Bundle Names
***********************************************************************
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER
1 #REPORT(A25)     /* (A17) xsiszha (CE7461)
1 #EXIST(L)
LOCAL
1 REPORTS  VIEW OF NRM-REPORTS-NEW
  2 R-REPNAME
*
END-DEFINE
FIND-NUM.
FIND NUMBER REPORTS  WITH R-REPNAME = #REPORT
IF *NUMBER(FIND-NUM.) > 0 MOVE TRUE TO #EXIST
ELSE
 MOVE FALSE TO #EXIST
END-IF
END
